**Type A — Single-driver thesis**

SunPower operates in a single market (U.S. residential solar installation), through a single distribution model (direct sales force + Sunder partnership), in a single regulatory environment (U.S. residential permitting/AHJ framework). The storage division is nascent and not yet a revenue driver — it cannot be counted as an independent demand driver offsetting the core installation business. Fixed cap ~35%.

